step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Enter the ruined house in the south-west of <col=800000>Mort'ton</col>. Search the shelf on the wall. Read the diary. After reading the diary, the quest is started and you are able to create <col=800000>Serum 207</col>.</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Enter the ruined house in the south-west of Mort'ton. Search the shelf on the wall. Read the diary. After reading the diary, the quest is started and you are able to create Serum 207.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>If you didn't bring <col=800000>Tarromin potion (unf)</col>: Pick up the empty vials (can be filled in the house north-east) and search the <col=800000>smashed table</col> for 2 <col=800000>grimy tarromin</col> and one <col=800000>grimy rogue's purse</col>.</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Enter the ruined house in the south-west of Mort'ton. Search the shelf on the wall. Read the diary. After reading the diary, the quest is started and you are able to create Serum 207.</str>
line	
line	<str>If you didn't bring Tarromin potion (unf): Pick up the empty vials (can be filled in the house north-east) and search the smashed table for 2 grimy tarromin and one grimy rogue's purse.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Make two <col=800000>Serum 207</col> by adding clean tarromin to a vial of water and then adding ashes.</col>
step	4	-	Quick guide step 4
line	<str>Enter the ruined house in the south-west of Mort'ton. Search the shelf on the wall. Read the diary. After reading the diary, the quest is started and you are able to create Serum 207.</str>
line	
line	<str>If you didn't bring Tarromin potion (unf): Pick up the empty vials (can be filled in the house north-east) and search the smashed table for 2 grimy tarromin and one grimy rogue's purse.</str>
line	
line	<str>Make two Serum 207 by adding clean tarromin to a vial of water and then adding ashes.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Use one dose on <col=800000>Razmire</col> (afflicted) in the general store. (Recommended to not use official Mort'ton temple World 377 yet to not get interrupted talking to the NPCs, until the step with repairing.)</col>
step	5	-	Quick guide step 5
line	<str>Enter the ruined house in the south-west of Mort'ton. Search the shelf on the wall. Read the diary. After reading the diary, the quest is started and you are able to create Serum 207.</str>
line	
line	<str>If you didn't bring Tarromin potion (unf): Pick up the empty vials (can be filled in the house north-east) and search the smashed table for 2 grimy tarromin and one grimy rogue's purse.</str>
line	
line	<str>Make two Serum 207 by adding clean tarromin to a vial of water and then adding ashes.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use one dose on Razmire (afflicted) in the general store. (Recommended to not use official Mort'ton temple World 377 yet to not get interrupted talking to the NPCs, until the step with repairing.)</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Kill five loar shades and pick up their remains. Note: any shades that you killed before talking to Razmire will not count.</col>
step	6	-	Quick guide step 6
line	<str>Enter the ruined house in the south-west of Mort'ton. Search the shelf on the wall. Read the diary. After reading the diary, the quest is started and you are able to create Serum 207.</str>
line	
line	<str>If you didn't bring Tarromin potion (unf): Pick up the empty vials (can be filled in the house north-east) and search the smashed table for 2 grimy tarromin and one grimy rogue's purse.</str>
line	
line	<str>Make two Serum 207 by adding clean tarromin to a vial of water and then adding ashes.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use one dose on Razmire (afflicted) in the general store. (Recommended to not use official Mort'ton temple World 377 yet to not get interrupted talking to the NPCs, until the step with repairing.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill five loar shades and pick up their remains. Note: any shades that you killed before talking to Razmire will not count.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Return to Razmire and give him the remains. He may require more Serum 207.</col>
step	7	-	Quick guide step 7
line	<str>Enter the ruined house in the south-west of Mort'ton. Search the shelf on the wall. Read the diary. After reading the diary, the quest is started and you are able to create Serum 207.</str>
line	
line	<str>If you didn't bring Tarromin potion (unf): Pick up the empty vials (can be filled in the house north-east) and search the smashed table for 2 grimy tarromin and one grimy rogue's purse.</str>
line	
line	<str>Make two Serum 207 by adding clean tarromin to a vial of water and then adding ashes.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use one dose on Razmire (afflicted) in the general store. (Recommended to not use official Mort'ton temple World 377 yet to not get interrupted talking to the NPCs, until the step with repairing.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill five loar shades and pick up their remains. Note: any shades that you killed before talking to Razmire will not count.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to Razmire and give him the remains. He may require more Serum 207.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Right click and open his General store, buy an Olive oil.</col>
step	8	-	Quick guide step 8
line	<str>Enter the ruined house in the south-west of Mort'ton. Search the shelf on the wall. Read the diary. After reading the diary, the quest is started and you are able to create Serum 207.</str>
line	
line	<str>If you didn't bring Tarromin potion (unf): Pick up the empty vials (can be filled in the house north-east) and search the smashed table for 2 grimy tarromin and one grimy rogue's purse.</str>
line	
line	<str>Make two Serum 207 by adding clean tarromin to a vial of water and then adding ashes.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use one dose on Razmire (afflicted) in the general store. (Recommended to not use official Mort'ton temple World 377 yet to not get interrupted talking to the NPCs, until the step with repairing.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill five loar shades and pick up their remains. Note: any shades that you killed before talking to Razmire will not count.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to Razmire and give him the remains. He may require more Serum 207.</str>
line	
line	<str>Right click and open his General store, buy an Olive oil.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Open his builders' store, buy 5 timber beams, 5 limestone bricks, 25 swamp paste and optionally a <col=800000>Flamtaer hammer</col>.</col>
step	9	-	Quick guide step 9
line	<str>Enter the ruined house in the south-west of Mort'ton. Search the shelf on the wall. Read the diary. After reading the diary, the quest is started and you are able to create Serum 207.</str>
line	
line	<str>If you didn't bring Tarromin potion (unf): Pick up the empty vials (can be filled in the house north-east) and search the smashed table for 2 grimy tarromin and one grimy rogue's purse.</str>
line	
line	<str>Make two Serum 207 by adding clean tarromin to a vial of water and then adding ashes.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use one dose on Razmire (afflicted) in the general store. (Recommended to not use official Mort'ton temple World 377 yet to not get interrupted talking to the NPCs, until the step with repairing.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill five loar shades and pick up their remains. Note: any shades that you killed before talking to Razmire will not count.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to Razmire and give him the remains. He may require more Serum 207.</str>
line	
line	<str>Right click and open his General store, buy an Olive oil.</str>
line	
line	<str>Open his builders' store, buy 5 timber beams, 5 limestone bricks, 25 swamp paste and optionally a Flamtaer hammer.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Use the serum on <col=800000>Ulsquire Shauncy</col>, located in the house east of the general store. Talk to him with Loar Remains.</col>
step	10	-	Quick guide step 10
line	<str>Enter the ruined house in the south-west of Mort'ton. Search the shelf on the wall. Read the diary. After reading the diary, the quest is started and you are able to create Serum 207.</str>
line	
line	<str>If you didn't bring Tarromin potion (unf): Pick up the empty vials (can be filled in the house north-east) and search the smashed table for 2 grimy tarromin and one grimy rogue's purse.</str>
