line	<str>Use the serum on Ulsquire Shauncy, located in the house east of the general store. Talk to him with Loar Remains.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to him again and ask about the remains and the temple.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head north-east of Mort'ton and repair the temple until you reach 100% repair and at least 20 sanctity. (Recommended to use official world 377.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Light the sacred altar in the centre of the temple (or wait until someone else lights it if you don't have level 5 Firemaking)</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your olive oil on the flame to make sacred oil.</str>
line	
line	<str>(Recommended) Use Serum 207 on the flame to make Serum 208, which permanently cures NPCs.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the sacred oil on a log to create a pyre log.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head west of Mort'ton general store, to any grouping of 4 stone funeral pyres. Use the pyre log, then Loar remains on a funeral pyre.</str>
line	
line	<str>Light the funeral pyre. Note: This will grant 25 Prayer XP.</str>
line	
line	<str>Collect the reward.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>(Recommended) Use the Serum 208 on Razmire.</col>
step	20	-	Quick guide step 20
line	<str>Enter the ruined house in the south-west of Mort'ton. Search the shelf on the wall. Read the diary. After reading the diary, the quest is started and you are able to create Serum 207.</str>
line	
line	<str>If you didn't bring Tarromin potion (unf): Pick up the empty vials (can be filled in the house north-east) and search the smashed table for 2 grimy tarromin and one grimy rogue's purse.</str>
line	
line	<str>Make two Serum 207 by adding clean tarromin to a vial of water and then adding ashes.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use one dose on Razmire (afflicted) in the general store. (Recommended to not use official Mort'ton temple World 377 yet to not get interrupted talking to the NPCs, until the step with repairing.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill five loar shades and pick up their remains. Note: any shades that you killed before talking to Razmire will not count.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to Razmire and give him the remains. He may require more Serum 207.</str>
line	
line	<str>Right click and open his General store, buy an Olive oil.</str>
line	
line	<str>Open his builders' store, buy 5 timber beams, 5 limestone bricks, 25 swamp paste and optionally a Flamtaer hammer.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the serum on Ulsquire Shauncy, located in the house east of the general store. Talk to him with Loar Remains.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to him again and ask about the remains and the temple.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head north-east of Mort'ton and repair the temple until you reach 100% repair and at least 20 sanctity. (Recommended to use official world 377.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Light the sacred altar in the centre of the temple (or wait until someone else lights it if you don't have level 5 Firemaking)</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your olive oil on the flame to make sacred oil.</str>
line	
line	<str>(Recommended) Use Serum 207 on the flame to make Serum 208, which permanently cures NPCs.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the sacred oil on a log to create a pyre log.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head west of Mort'ton general store, to any grouping of 4 stone funeral pyres. Use the pyre log, then Loar remains on a funeral pyre.</str>
line	
line	<str>Light the funeral pyre. Note: This will grant 25 Prayer XP.</str>
line	
line	<str>Collect the reward.</str>
line	
line	<str>(Recommended) Use the Serum 208 on Razmire.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Use the Serum 208 on Ulsquire and finish the dialogue.</col>
